    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## UrbanCart Knowledge Base Ingestion\nStaff drop/replace product & policy docs in the watched Drive folder. The two triggers below only catch files created/updated AFTER they start polling — they do NOT backfill files that were already sitting in the folder.\n\nRun supabase_schema_patch.sql once in Supabase SQL Editor first (adds tickets.summary + match_doc_chunks), then click 'Execute workflow' on the Manual Backfill Trigger (bottom) once to ingest everything already in the folder. After that, activate this workflow and the two pollers keep it in sync going forward.",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 1008,
        "color": 3
      },
